.TH ITCMDR 7 "" "itcmdr" "itcmdr manual"
.SH NAME
itcmdr \- self-healing IT for small offices
.SH DESCRIPTION
itcmdr is a site server, a Rust agent on every machine, a site app, an optional offsite admin server (adminsvr) with an admin app and CLI. The guides are in docs/ and in the in-app help.
.SH PROGRAMS
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-cli\fR(1)
site server administration on the server itself
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-adminsvr\fR(1)
offsite admin server (admin API, SiteLink, Let's Encrypt)
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-admin\fR(1)
command line client for adminsvr
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-agent\fR(1)
Rust agent that runs on every office machine
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-agent\-watchdog\fR(1)
keeps itcmdr\-agent running and rolls back bad upgrades
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-server\-watchdog\fR(1)
keeps itcmdr\-server running and rolls back bad upgrades
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-server\fR(1)
the site server (gRPC for the agents, HTTPS API for the apps)
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-restore\fR(1)
restore helper started by the server for an app or CLI restore
.TP
\fBitcmdr\-plugin\-ps\fR(1)
host for PowerShell check plugins
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ITCMDR_SERVER_CONFIG
path of server.json (itcmdr\-server, itcmdr\-cli)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_DATA_DIR
data folder (\-\-data\-dir beats it; it beats server.json) (itcmdr\-server, itcmdr\-cli)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_SERVER_PROGRAM
the server program folder for self\-upgrade (default: the exe's folder) (itcmdr\-server)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_RESTORE_BIN
path of itcmdr\-restore (default: next to the server) (itcmdr\-server)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_PLUGIN_PS_HOST
path of itcmdr\-plugin\-ps (default: next to the exe) (itcmdr\-server, itcmdr\-agent)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_POWERSHELL
PowerShell to run (default powershell.exe on Windows, pwsh elsewhere) (itcmdr\-plugin\-ps, itcmdr\-server)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_PLUGIN_SCRIPT
the plugin script, instead of \-\-script (itcmdr\-plugin\-ps)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_AGENT_DIR
agent data folder (default %ProgramData%\\itcmdr\\agent, /var/lib/itcmdr\-agent) (itcmdr\-agent, itcmdr\-agent\-watchdog)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_AGENT_PROGRAM
the agent program folder (holding current\\) for self\-upgrade (itcmdr\-agent)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_PLUGIN_START_SECS
seconds a plugin has to answer the handshake (default 60) (itcmdr\-agent)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_PS_MODULE
path of Itcmdr.Plugin.psm1 for PowerShell plugins (itcmdr\-agent, plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMIN_HOME
this device's identity folder (default: the user config folder) (itcmdr\-admin)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_FIDO2_DEVICE
libfido2 device path for passkeys (default: the first one) (itcmdr\-admin)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_EXTRA_ROOTS
extra PEM root files added to the system trust store (PATH\-style list) (itcmdr\-admin, itcmdr\-cli)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ENV_FILE
KEY=VALUE settings file (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_DB_URL
postgres://... or sqlite://<path> (default SQLite in the data folder) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_DATA_DIR
data folder (default /var/lib/itcmdr\-adminsvr) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_API_ADDR
admin API listen address (default 0.0.0.0:8444) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_SITE_ADDR
SiteLink listen address (default 0.0.0.0:8443) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_PUBLIC_API
host:port clients use (put into enrollment codes) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_PUBLIC_SITE
host:port sites use (put into site tokens) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_TLS_NAMES
extra internal certificate names, comma separated (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_HEARTBEAT_SECS
site status interval (default 60) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_SITE_MISSED
missed heartbeats before a site is down (default 5) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_RP_ID
WebAuthn RP id (default: the host of the public API) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_WEB_ORIGINS
extra WebAuthn origins, comma separated (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT
Firebase service account JSON (push to Android) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_FCM_URL
FCM endpoint override (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_APNS_KEY
APNs .p8 auth key file (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_APNS_KEY_ID
APNs key id (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_APNS_TEAM_ID
Apple team id (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_APNS_TOPIC
the admin app's bundle id (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_APNS_URL
APNs endpoint (sandbox for development builds) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_PUSH_MIN_SEVERITY
lowest pushed severity (default cautious) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_DOMAINS
Let's Encrypt names for the admin API, comma separated (empty = off) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_CONTACT
ACME account contact e\-mail(s) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_DIRECTORY
production, staging or a directory URL (default production) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_DIRECTORY_ROOT
PEM root for a test CA's directory (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_CHALLENGE
tls\-alpn\-01 (default) or http\-01 (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_HTTP_ADDR
HTTP\-01 listener (default 0.0.0.0:80) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_CACHE_DIR
account key and certificate (default <data dir>/acme) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_RENEW_DAYS
renew this many days before expiry (default 30) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_ACME_RETRY_SECS
wait after a failed attempt (default 3600) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_BACKUP_DIR
v1.2.0 folder for adminsvr's own backups (default <data dir>/backups; [adminsvr backup](BACKUP\-ADMINSVR.md)) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_BACKUP_HOUR
nightly backup hour, 0\-23 local, or off (default 3) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ADMINSVR_BACKUP_KEEP
nightly backups kept (default 14; manual ones are never pruned) (itcmdr\-adminsvr)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_PLUGIN_SECRET
per\-launch secret for the plugin protocol (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_LOG_PATH
the run's itcmdr.log/v1 file (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_RUN_ID
the run id (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_MACHINE
the machine name (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_REPORT_ONLY
1 = do not repair (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ARTIFACT_DIR
folder for files the plugin hands back (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_SITE_PATH
site.json for the PowerShell checks (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_CHECKS_LIB
path of Itcmdr.Checks.ps1 (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_TCP_TIMEOUT_MS
TCP check timeout override (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_IMPORT_ONLY
load the PowerShell agent's functions without running it (plugins)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_TEST_SLOW
scale test deadlines (default 3) (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_TEST_PG_URL
use this Postgres instead of starting one (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_PG_BIN
Postgres binaries for tests (default ~/Projects/tools/pgsql/bin) (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_REQUIRE_PG
fail instead of skipping without Postgres (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_SKIP_PEBBLE
skip the Let's Encrypt (Pebble) test (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_REGEN_VECTORS
regenerate signing vectors (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_RESTORE_FORCE_HEALTH_FAIL
make the restore health check fail (rollback test) (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_E2E_BIN_DIR
server binaries for the app's end\-to\-end test (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_KEYS_BRIDGE_LIB
the app's Rust bridge library for Dart tests (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_FAULT_ROOT
fault\-injection suite root (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_FAULT_SERVICE
service name for the fault suite (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_FAULT_TESTBED
enables the fault suite (testbed machines only) (tests)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_PLUGINS_REPO
plugins repository for fetch\-plugins.sh (scripts)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_LEAK_PATTERNS
extra leak patterns for release\-local.sh check (scripts)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_KEEP_BUILD
1: release\-local.sh skips its automatic clean step after unix/android/ios\-check (to chain several targets; run release\-local.sh clean at the end) (scripts)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_SITE_DIR
path of the site\-branch checkout (assets+demos) for a local Jaspr build; default: sibling itcmdr\-site worktree (site_jaspr/tool/sync_web.sh)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_BUILD_COMMIT
git commit written into every binary's build stamp (default git rev\-parse HEAD); set by release\-local.sh and release\-windows.ps1 (build (help/build.rs), release scripts)
.TP
.B ITCMDR_ALLOW_UNTAGGED
1: release\-local.sh builds a trial from a commit that is not the version tag (check refuses it) (scripts)
